91ec47b8-db0e-11ef-9cbc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"勃海，唐滄、景州。清河，唐貝州。信都，唐冀州。師古曰：湓，湧也；音普頓翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"勃海，唐沧、景州。清河，唐贝州。信都，唐冀州。师古曰：湓，涌也；音普顿翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"91ec47ad-db0e-11ef-8fd0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"91ee6a90-db0e-11ef-9dee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"91ee6a91-db0e-11ef-812f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：乙十一行本「尋」下有「等」字；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：乙十一行本「寻」下有「等」字；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91ee6a8f-db0e-11ef-9321-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"91ec47ba-db0e-11ef-983b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索，山客翻。塞，悉則翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索，山客翻。塞，悉则翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"91ee6a92-db0e-11ef-b41f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91ee6a94-db0e-11ef-9b3c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：處業，謂安處之，使得居業。數，所角翻。處，昌呂翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：处业，谓安处之，使得居业。数，所角翻。处，昌吕翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"91ee6a93-db0e-11ef-8126-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李尋","people_name_jianti_auto":"李寻","people_xingming":"李寻","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"91ee9225-db0e-11ef-bf88-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"91ec47ac-db0e-11ef-842d-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"pén","source_anchor_text":"信都河水湓溢灌縣邑","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":13,"text":"湓","tongjian_id":"e5dae649-62ef-5274-a317-57982396934a"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"勃海","place_name_jianti_auto":"勃海","resolved_place_entity_id":528,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"91ee9221-db0e-11ef-a216-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清河","place_name_jianti_auto":"清河","resolved_place_entity_id":452,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"91ee9222-db0e-11ef-aac4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"信都","place_name_jianti_auto":"信都","resolved_place_entity_id":617,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"91ee9223-db0e-11ef-92df-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河水","place_name_jianti_auto":"河水","resolved_place_entity_id":42,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"91ee9224-db0e-11ef-ab7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"平陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1289,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"91ee9226-db0e-11ef-83de-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九河","place_name_jianti_auto":"九河","resolved_place_entity_id":2789,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"91ee9227-db0e-11ef-9d39-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":42,"start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"91ee9228-db0e-11ef-a306-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"三十一年，孙禁请决平原金堤间，开通大河，令入故笃马河，至...","context_before":"笃马河[州东南四十里。《汉志》：平原有笃马河。","source_end_index":44,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2fb5ce36-2772-5f48-b570-476bd7b1e7a7","source_start_index":23,"source_text":"鸿嘉四年，渤海、清河、信都河，水溢灌县邑。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。后汉兴平二年，李傕等寇长安，帝幸陕，别将李乐欲令车驾御...","context_before":"...之。乃令镌之。才没水中，不能复去，而令湍流沸怒，为害弥甚","source_end_index":400,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3435fecb-528a-5818-a498-00f3e4d9ad43","source_start_index":383,"source_text":"[是年秋，勃海、清河、信都河水溢]"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷四十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/◎川渎二大河上（卷一百二十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"新莽始建国三年，河决魏郡，泛清河以东数郡[汉所称魏郡，大...","context_before":"...金堤，泛滥兖、豫，入平原、千乘、济南，凡灌四郡三十二县。","source_end_index":237,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e9d6ffd9-cf41-530c-ab82-90f0bfb282dc","source_start_index":211,"source_text":"又鸿嘉四年，清河、勃海、信都河水湓溢，灌县邑三十一。"}],"path":"川渎/◎川渎二大河上（卷一百二十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1秋，勃海、清河、信都河水湓溢，灌縣、邑三十一，敗官亭、民舍四萬餘所。平陵李尋奏言：「議者常欲求索九河故迹而穿之。今因其自決，可且勿塞，以觀水勢；河欲居之，當稍自成川，跳出沙土。然後順天心而圖之，必有成功，而用財力寡。」於是遂止不塞。朝臣數言百姓可哀，上遣使者處業振贍之。","content_fanyi":"秋季，勃海、清河、信都各郡境内黄河水漫溢而出，淹没三十一个县、邑，冲毁邮亭、民房四万余所。平陵人李寻上奏说：“先前参与廷议治河的官员常想寻找九河故道遗迹，重新加以疏通利用。如今趁着黄河自行决口，可以暂且不要堵塞，以便观察水势；黄河所流经之处，会逐渐自行形成河川，冲刷出泥沙。然后顺应天意加以筹划治理，必定能够成功，而且所用财力人力很少。”于是停止治河，不再堵塞决口。朝廷大臣多次上言说受灾百姓可怜，汉成帝这才派遣使者前往灾区安置生业、赈济灾民，帮助他们重建家园。","content_jianti_auto":"1秋，勃海、清河、信都河水湓溢，灌县、邑三十一，败官亭、民舍四万余所。平陵李寻奏言：「议者常欲求索九河故迹而穿之。今因其自决，可且勿塞，以观水势；河欲居之，当稍自成川，跳出沙土。然后顺天心而图之，必有成功，而用财力寡。」于是遂止不塞。朝臣数言百姓可哀，上遣使者处业振赡之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2450,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91ec47ac-db0e-11ef-842d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91ee922b-db0e-11ef-ad65-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：賊黨相捕斬，赦其本罪。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：贼党相捕斩，赦其本罪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"91ee922a-db0e-11ef-a1c1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河東都尉","official_note":"都尉是漢代郡級軍事長官，河東都尉負責河東郡的軍事防務。在上下文中，趙護從河東都尉調任廣漢太守，顯示其職務變動。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以河東都尉趙護爲廣漢太守","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"335ed895-a402-468b-87a2-d783dc7807fb"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"廣漢太守","official_note":"太守是漢代郡級最高行政長官，廣漢太守負責廣漢郡的民政和治安。在上下文中，趙護被任命為廣漢太守以平定鄭躬叛亂。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以河東都尉趙護爲廣漢太守","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"89d88984-f008-4653-b52f-5d9c079ff522"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"執金吾","official_note":"執金吾是漢代京師衛戍長官，負責宮廷和京城的警衛。在上下文中，趙護因平定叛亂有功，被升遷為執金吾。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"遷護爲執金吾","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"c4615b66-7b20-4810-a3db-2ed515be3963"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-17,"link_td_description":"郑躬，西汉广汉郡民變首领。","link_td_id":"Q10001453","link_td_number_id":193647,"people_name":"鄭躬","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑躬","people_xingming":"郑躬","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"91ee922c-db0e-11ef-aabc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙護","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵护","people_xingming":"赵护","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"91ee922d-db0e-11ef-ab8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"護","people_name_jianti_auto":"护","people_xingming":"赵护","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"91ee9232-db0e-11ef-bd20-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"廣漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"广汉","resolved_place_entity_id":688,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"91ee922e-db0e-11ef-8074-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","resolved_place_entity_id":105,"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"91ee922f-db0e-11ef-ad11-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"广汉","resolved_place_entity_id":688,"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"91ee9230-db0e-11ef-9df2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀郡","resolved_place_entity_id":38,"start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"91ee9231-db0e-11ef-a9be-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事","人事"],"content":"2廣漢鄭躬黨與寖廣，犯歷四縣，衆且萬人；州郡不能制。冬，以河東都尉趙護爲廣漢太守，發郡中及蜀郡合三萬人擊之，或相捕斬除罪；旬月平。遷護爲執金吾，賜黃金百斤。","content_fanyi":"广汉人郑躬的党羽日益增多，势力逐步扩大，先后侵犯四个县，部众将近一万人；州郡长官无法控制。冬季，朝廷任命河东郡都尉赵护为广汉太守，赵护征调广汉郡和蜀郡的兵力合计三万人进击，并下令：郑躬部众中如有互相捕杀或投降官军的，一律赦免本人罪责；一个月内便平定叛乱。提升赵护为执金吾，赏赐黄金一百斤。","content_jianti_auto":"2广汉郑躬党与寖广，犯历四县，众且万人；州郡不能制。冬，以河东都尉赵护为广汉太守，发郡中及蜀郡合三万人击之，或相捕斩除罪；旬月平。迁护为执金吾，赐黄金百斤。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2451,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"91ee9229-db0e-11ef-9bc8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91ee9236-db0e-11ef-92c0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢制，列將軍置幕府，得舉吏。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉制，列将军置幕府，得举吏。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"91ee9235-db0e-11ef-a657-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"榮譽官銜","official_name":"特進","official_note":"特進是漢代授予高級官員的榮譽官銜，通常用於表彰功績或地位，此處成都侯商以特進身份領城門兵，表示皇帝賦予他特殊權力以加強控制。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以特進領城門兵","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"e952db6d-a620-4b25-bc09-bce798797187"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"軍事指揮","of